, giant sizes, and dedicated fish collection books.\n- Large local bosses in each zone. Fight them for extended periods and compete for the fastest records throughout the game.\n- Build a house, decorate it, dig a soil pond, set up an aquarium, and rebirth to upgrade your house and unlock new zones.\n- Drive cars, ride boats, and ride elephants to fish all over the map.\n- At night, be careful of people sneaking in to steal fish from the pond!\n\nIf you find any bugs or have ideas, please let us know on the game's Discord server (RiverHunter).","thumbs":["https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-11c809e5151a0a10ec0ff6f45c7c6e0b/768/432/Image/Webp/noFilter","https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-3cebf84853d8e94618000782a7ec5dbd/768/432/Image/Webp/noFilter","https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-e1ca0991ba16d92dc39dc2d73a0fe4b3/768/432/Image/Webp/noFilter"],"passes":[{"id":2087912664,"name":"Elephant Fish Tank","price":199,"icon":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-7b36d5a3b404f2e6136b4850623c76c2/150/150/Image/Webp/noFilter"},{"id":2089448560,"name":"Explorer Elephant","price":599,"icon":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-7b36d5a3b404f2e6136b4850623c76c2/150/150/Image/Webp/noFilter"},{"id":2088680472,"name":"Fast Bite","price":199,"icon":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-462fe8e76759226fc856e2d2ce714f3f/150/150/Image/Webp/noFilter"},{"id":2089958495,"name":"Bucket +10","price":149,"icon":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-66c5f2841c66eacdc3284973032633d7/150/150/Image/Webp/noFilter"},{"id":2088884497,"name":"Money x2","price":289,"icon":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-bdde9584ba18c2a932556d2f7260c45d/150/150/Image/Webp/noFilter"},{"id":2089592500,"name":"Luck x2","price":299,"icon":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-67b14e31fb7f1a6ffc7779b112fbba6b/150/150/Image/Webp/noFilter"}],"badges":[],"extrasAt":1795002011902}